  "design": {
    "entrance": "A hyper-fast approach from the vanishing point through rushing speed lines, with zoom/directional blur proportional to velocity, then a hard speed-ramp deceleration.",
    "reveal": "At the impact frame the title brakes to a near standstill: red edge flash, anamorphic streak, speed lines freeze and drift; a slow-motion creep carries the long, readable hold.",
    "camera": "Forward rush with impact jolt; then a barely-moving slow-motion creep.",
    "material": "Gloss white enamel with red (ACCENT) rim and impact accent.",
    "exit": "Reverse ramp: the title accelerates away into the vanishing point with zoom blur as the lines rush again."
  },
  "fusion_notes": [
    "Motion blur: 'Motion Blur Amount' scales the DirectionalBlur (Zoom type) length on the title and on the speed-line field."
